  "assumptions": [
    "Employer contact is stored as one primary contact per employer; multiple contacts require table extension.",
    "Eligibility validation result is captured at enrollment against active scheme rules.",
    "Duplicate or invalid registrations are quarantined by setting member status with a reason.",
    "Exception and discrepancy tracking is consolidated into reconciliation status.",
    "Material change and financial action audit evidence is captured via audit trail with entity type and actor.",
    "Benefit approval separation is enforced by requiring a distinct approver from submitter in BenefitApproval.",
    "Allocation amount is recorded per member, employer and scheme as required.",
    "Investment change traceability is recorded via audit trail referencing the investment entity."
  ]
